    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "d9CxYg",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "README — how this file is organised",
      "width": 520,
      "height": 210,
      "content": "BRAWLING MAHOGANY — Basic Designs\n\nTokens: variables mirror docs/Design System.md §2–3 (oklch converted to hex).\nNever use a raw colour in a node — always $token.\n\nCANVAS LAYOUT\n• y ≈ 0–2400   reusable components (edit these, instances update everywhere)\n• y ≈ 2500+    screens, in rows, left→right in priority order\n• Screens are ref instances of the AppShell component with the Content slot replaced.\n\nKEY COMPONENT IDs\nAppShell qZ3UW (Sidebar VbcDM · TopBar mmdX6 · Content slot o9a0dM)\nSidebar ebYkA · TopBar VGZzn · DealHeader t1W04 · Tab BcJt6\nStatusBadge PpgH1 · DealRow kNzFR · TaskItem bsrMo · ActivityItem FpdA2\nButton-Primary VqwXm · Button-Secondary YFTqj · Button-Ghost eJDgx\nIconButton Ixv7k · Avatar C5VYg · NavItem DSIFL · DateChip JY1uE · Checkbox AXS2m\n\nSCREEN FRAME SIZES\n1440×1024 internal app · 1440×1200 dense lists (S13) · 390×1607 client page (S62)"
    }
  ],
